@type project
@title Atlas
@summary A lightweight planning tool for small teams.

# About

Atlas is a lightweight planning tool designed to help small teams organize projects without adding unnecessary process.

I designed and built the interface, focusing on clear navigation, fast interactions, and accessibility.

The goal was to keep planning simple: make it easy to understand what is happening, what needs attention, and what comes next.

# My Role

I worked across product design and front-end development, from early interface concepts through implementation.

This included designing the core workflows, building reusable interface components, and refining the experience across different screen sizes.